  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-01-29T21:12:45.775Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRChat Version: 2022.4.2p1:1275-6605010995\n\nDescription of the bug: On the VRChat website and in-game, my blocks and mutes from the past 6 months have been undone without my input, bringing my block list from 50-60 people down to 21.\n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): I logged onto the website today and clicked on my block and mute list where I saw it was no longer showing the people I added in the past 6 months. Then I opened the game in desktop mode to find it was the same there.\n\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots): Attached are screenshots from the website and in-game, the latter with the block list in compact mode and names censored to show how small it has gotten.",
